      "id": "shader-implementation-contract",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 2,
          "text": "Shader implementation contract"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "WGSL modules are assembled through engine imports, chunk registration and ShaderBuilder. Functions, structures and bindings below come directly from the checked-out shader files. A file can be a reusable include, an active entry point or a retained experimental/legacy variant; file presence alone does not establish that it executes in the default pipeline."
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "Follow the corresponding geometry, fragment and pass API before changing an entry point. CPU data offsets, WGSL alignment, bindings, varying interpolation, reversed depth and workgroup sizes must continue to agree."
        }
      ]
    },
